Admin Management Module\
\
1. Admins can reset a user\'92s password only via an email link. (Admins should not be allowed to change users\'92 passwords directly without their acknowledgment, as it may create confusion during login.)\
2. The system should not automatically delete an employee\'92s data when they resign. (Past employee data may still be important for the company. Data should only be deleted manually by the admin.)\
