\
Leave Management Module\
\
1. The leave calendar should display only the logged-in employee\'92s leaves. (Displaying all employees\'92 leaves may create conflicts. Only HR or managers should be able to view the complete leave calendar for all employees.)\
2. The system should not auto-approve leave requests on weekends. (All leave requests should require proper approval.)\
\
Time & Attendance Module\
\
1. Employees should be allowed to request corrections for missed punches, but changes should only be applied after manager approval.\
\
Recruitment Module\
\
1. Candidates should not be able to view other applicants\'92 profiles. (Only HR should have access to all applications. Candidates should only be able to view their own application status and progress.)\
